abstract: >-
  An interactive web application for exploring georeferenced occurrence records
  of Brazilian amphibians and reptiles, with multi-species visualization,
  biome-based exploration, KMZ spatial filtering, and provenance-aware export.
keywords:
  - herpetology
  - biodiversity informatics
  - amphibians
  - reptiles
  - species distribution
  - geospatial data

